{"id":"dulce","lemma":"dulce","pos":"adj","rank":629,"glosses":["sweet (having a pleasant taste, especially induced by sugar)","sweet (having a pleasant disposition)","fresh (without salt)"],"ipa":"/ˈdulθe/","forms":{"femininePlural":"dulces"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/ba/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-dulce.wav","examples":[{"text":"El azúcar es dulce.","en":"Sugar is sweet.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/636790"},{"text":"Me gustan los dulces.","en":"I like candy.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/438055"},{"text":"Eso es tan dulce.","en":"That's so sweet.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/442073"},{"text":"Los duraznos son dulces.","en":"Peaches taste sweet.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/513095"},{"text":"Esta torta es dulce.","en":"This cake is sweet.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/788366"}]}